1
00:00:12,552 --> 00:00:17,684
Alors, ton premier jour ? Raconte !
So, your first day? Tell me!

2
00:00:17,784 --> 00:00:26,012
D'abord, je suis arrivée au bureau à neuf heures. Ensuite, j'ai rencontré mes collègues.
First, I arrived at the office at nine. Then I met my colleagues.

3
00:00:26,112 --> 00:00:29,372
Et vous avez déjeuné ensemble ?
And did you have lunch together?

4
00:00:29,472 --> 00:00:34,388
Oui, puis j'ai suivi une formation pendant l'après-midi.
Yes, then I did a training session during the afternoon.

5
00:00:34,488 --> 00:00:36,884
Et le soir ?
And in the evening?

6
00:00:36,984 --> 00:00:43,436
Enfin, je suis rentrée à pied. Je n'ai jamais autant marché !
Finally, I walked home. I've never walked so much!

7
00:00:43,536 --> 00:00:46,052
Tu es fatiguée ?
Are you tired?

8
00:00:46,152 --> 00:00:50,276
Un peu, mais j'ai adoré cette journée.
A little, but I loved this day.
